# 🌌 ORBITAL — Solar System Explorer

An interactive 3D solar system experience that lets users explore planets, control the simulation, and discover key planetary facts.

🔗 **Live Demo:** https://lahboub763.github.io/ORBITAL/

## ✨ Features

- **Interactive 3D Scene** — Explore a visual representation of the Solar System.
- **Planet Selection** — Select planets and explore their information.
- **Focus Mode** — Focus the camera on a selected planet.
- **Zoom Controls** — Zoom in and out of the scene.
- **Pause and Resume** — Control the simulation.
- **Orbital Paths** — Show or hide planetary orbits.
- **Planet Labels** — Show or hide planet labels.
- **Responsive Interface** — Explore the application on different screen sizes.

## 🛠️ Technologies

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Three.js
- Git and GitHub Pages

## 🚀 Getting Started

To run the project locally:

1. Clone the repository:

   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/lahboub763/ORBITAL.git
   ```

2. Open the project folder in Visual Studio Code.
3. Launch `index.html` using the Live Server extension.

